flowchart TD
    START[Service Bus delivers event] --> VALIDATE{Valid event and schema?}
    VALIDATE -- No --> PERM[Dead-letter with safe reason code]
    VALIDATE -- Yes --> PROCESS[Function writes Blob if needed, then Cosmos]
    PROCESS --> SUCCESS{All required durable writes succeeded?}
    SUCCESS -- Yes --> COMPLETE[Complete Service Bus message]
    SUCCESS -- No --> TRANSIENT{Transient and retryable?}
    TRANSIENT -- Yes --> RETRY[Retry / abandon with bounded policy]
    RETRY --> COUNT{Max delivery count exceeded?}
    COUNT -- No --> START
    COUNT -- Yes --> DLQ[Subscription dead-letter queue]
    TRANSIENT -- No --> PERM
    PERM --> DLQ
    DLQ --> ALERT[Alert and inspect reason, eventId, correlationId]
    ALERT --> FIX[Fix dependency/configuration or quarantine invalid event]
    FIX --> APPROVE{Safe to replay?}
    APPROVE -- No --> HOLD[Keep quarantined; document disposition]
    APPROVE -- Yes --> REPLAY[Controlled replay preserving original eventId]
    REPLAY --> START
    COMPLETE --> END[Processing finished]
